# Island 4 — bark and root, and the spores that drift whether you move or not.
# The first three seconds are deliberately motionless: the standing-still view loop is what
# keeps the frame alive while the player is not, and that is the whole point.
#
# Shot from the 1-wide corridor at x=20, y=7..13 rather than the room at the map entry.
# The lantern rides on the eye, so walls one tile away are the only walls it actually
# reaches — the entry room is eight tiles wide and the first take of this shot came back
# too dark to read the bark at all.
DESC="Island 4 · Rootvault · TEXTURED / BARK"
ISLAND=sylvandar
DUNGEON=rootvault
AT="20,13"
FACING=0
SECONDS_LEN=8
CAMERA_RATE=0.4
MOVE="3:F,4.2:F,5.4:F,6.6:F"
WIDTH=1920
HEIGHT=1080
